<BODY>
<FONT FACE="Times3">

<H3>HOW THIS FILE WAS MADE</H3>

<UL>
<li>Open Eva's file KTindexuni.doc (dated 23 august 2004)
<li>Select everything
<li>Start "BlocNote" (NotePad)
<li>Paste, and save in UTF8 text format (KTindE.utf)
<li>apply UTF_2pdy.bat and obtain a new file  (KTindE.pdy)
<li>run the dos command: [find "v.r." KTindE.pdy &gt; kt_vr.pdy
<li>"slightly" edit the result and make it into an hyperlinked file
<BR>(for instance make a search and replace of *.[0-9]* by ^J&lt;BR&gt;@*.?*, etc.
<li>interprete the statistics ... (there seems to be 710 occ. of 227 distinct v.r. (= verbal roots)
<li>Do the same with other categories
</UL>

<HR>
<H3>STATISTICS</H3>

<UL>
<li>Anthology name: Kuüuntokai (=KT)
<li>Anthology length: 2504 lines
<li>Number of "v.r.": 710 occ. (of 227 distinct elements)
<li>Density of "v.r.": 710/2504 = 28%
<li>Number of "ceyyum" type PE (peyar eccam): 361 occ. (of 193 distinct elements)
<li>Density of "ceyyum" type PE: 361/2504 = 14.4%
<li>Number of "ceyta" type PE (peyar eccam): 438 occ. (of 227 distinct elements)
<li>Density of "ceyta" type PE: 438/2504 = 17.5 %
</UL>


<HR>
<H3>List of Lists</H3>
